{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cloud Piercer",
    "steam_appid": 3304500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to go on an adventure! Embark aboard an airship to discover the secrets of the clouds and... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows? How far can you go? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Piercer is a steampunk survival game with simple and effective mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are a group of adventurers at the controls of a flying machine, your duty will be to maintain it and subsist by exploring your environment, braving its dangers and exploiting its resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the sky, find resources, destroy enemies, pierce the clouds to reveal their mysteries and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against multiple types of war machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fortresses to collect resources that will allow you to continue your journey but also to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Edens, flying paradises filled with supplies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new flying machines but also devastating attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and earn points to unlock better ships and special abilities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to go on an adventure! Embark aboard an airship to discover the secrets of the clouds and... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows? How far can you go? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Piercer is a steampunk survival game with simple and effective mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are a group of adventurers at the controls of a flying machine, your duty will be to maintain it and subsist by exploring your environment, braving its dangers and exploiting its resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the sky, find resources, destroy enemies, pierce the clouds to reveal their mysteries and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against multiple types of war machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fortresses to collect resources that will allow you to continue your journey but also to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Edens, flying paradises filled with supplies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new flying machines but also devastating attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and earn points to unlock better ships and special abilities.</p>",
    "short_description": "It's time to go on an adventure! Board an airship, load your cannons, set off to discover the secrets of the clouds and... Who knows? How far can you go?",
